  "master": "E:\\pd-media\\episodes\\PD-2026-074-itaewon\\06_voice\\master\\short297_vc_master_en_us_v002.mp3",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "L1",
      "chunk_id": "L1",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "A hundred and fifty-nine people died. A court convicted one official, acquitted another, and explained the difference in one sentence about who the law was written for.",
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 12.678,
      "seconds": 12.678,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:b7e11077b0e08c7b38185145b14a5ab78d5ad68cdc43b73474c4c78b29286c1e"
    },
    {
      "id": "L2",
      "chunk_id": "L2",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "Nobody organised it. There was no ticket, no promoter, no stage, no permit, no name on anything. Hold on to that, because in two years' time a court is going to build an acquittal on it.",
      "start": 12.898,
      "end": 19.307,
      "seconds": 6.409,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:474943d9bbccc49c6990b448018090e06b74632234ac9086aad613b1627cdec2"
    },
    {
      "id": "L3",
      "chunk_id": "L3",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "The chief of the ward office, and other ward officials, were indicted. The court found them not guilty.",
      "start": 19.527,
      "end": 24.682,
      "seconds": 5.155,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:d561214e90a7b68f8c70ccd794e0cf55d39c55155100f9bf5eca0cf0b54cbc3a"
    },
    {
      "id": "L4",
      "chunk_id": "L4",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Not insufficient evidence. Something more specific than that.",
      "start": 24.902,
      "end": 27.828,
      "seconds": 2.926,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:e2a1335f4a3333c759427e7cc28449b5938a3fb0590e8a59f0ce9048db702965"
    },
    {
      "id": "L5",
      "chunk_id": "L5",
      "delivery": "intense",
      "text": "Related law and regulations did not require them to come up with safety measures for events without organizers.",
      "start": 28.048,
      "end": 33.064,
      "seconds": 5.016,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:009f59e79be15d5b119d669b3453672e7237c1c08cd57ba67b7d545a81a18a0e"
    },
    {
      "id": "L6",
      "chunk_id": "L6",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "A hundred thousand people walking into a district because it is the twenty-ninth of October is not anybody's event. There is no form for it.",
      "start": 33.284,
      "end": 41.272,
      "seconds": 7.988,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:211c70344e124f1aed87bf420da277504b06cb8c2f80a133c7bca1e9a6c36215"
    },
    {
      "id": "L7",
      "chunk_id": "L7",
      "delivery": "building",
      "text": "And so, in the judgment of that court, there was no duty attached to it. There is now.",
      "start": 41.492,
      "end": 46.09,
      "seconds": 4.598,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:0be1234b924f7ab02f28f0924b1469f69b9129f59a298d2a184fde50c14c5522"
    },
    {
      "id": "L8",
      "chunk_id": "L8",
      "delivery": "calm",
      "text": "The law now knows that a crowd can happen without anybody calling it an event. On the night this film is about, it was not law.",
      "start": 46.31,
      "end": 53.276,
      "seconds": 6.966,
      "idempotency_key": "sha256:8f8ccb228a75888f97a4d4315ffe8b226631a434d704a9921a82b514596a59f1"
    }
  ]
}
